- New covers are light pink, not rejected blue/honey; green text meets 4.5:1 contrast.
- No photo archive selection, mask changes or five-piece Chocolate composition is implied.
- Website has the same 15 photo records, all media hashes, photo-first notebooks and no-scroll behavior.
- GitHub repository and Pages names are verified, not inferred from the user's typo.

